=== B&O's 'effective volume' remark, decoded ===
 eps = 0.1: V_eff = 40 pi^2/(9 w sig^2) = 4386.49/w^3 = 17.68 lambda^3 (= 5 lambda^3/(9 pi eps^2) = 17.68 lambda^3) = 43.86 x (1/w)(1/sig)^2
 eps = 0.15: V_eff = 40 pi^2/(9 w sig^2) = 1949.55/w^3 = 7.86 lambda^3 (= 5 lambda^3/(9 pi eps^2) = 7.86 lambda^3) = 43.86 x (1/w)(1/sig)^2
 Reading: eq.8 = (8 pi/15) G^2 (N w)^2 / V_eff, i.e. N gravitons crossing isotropically inside V_eff. In the free field the
 N gravitons sit on a shell of thickness ~1/sig; during the focus (|t| < ~1/sig) a fraction ~ (lambda sig) of them is inside
 a wavelength of the origin crossing at all angles, and (N lambda sig)^2/lambda^3 = N^2 sig^2/lambda reproduces N^2/V_eff with
 V_eff ~ lambda/sig^2: the 'coherence enhancement' IS the geometric focus of the source-free (incoming + outgoing) solution.
